WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.625
In a reaction atoms are rearranged; none are made or destroyed.

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:08.800
Hydrogen and oxygen react to make water.

3
00:00:10.306 --> 00:00:14.081
Check the atom tally: the same atoms before and now.

4
00:00:14.709 --> 00:00:19.434
Atoms are rearranged, not made or destroyed, so mass is conserved.
